                "title": "12 Inch Concealed Screw Surface Bolt, Deltana 12SBCS",
                "description": "12 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt, Deltana 12SBCS - This 12 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt with concealed screws is supplied with 3 different strikes, (universal, mortise, and angle strike) for easy installation in almost any application. Contemporary styled with a fully concealed screw design improves security and appearance. The surface mounted door bolt is designed with a unique ball bearing tension system that holds the door bolt in any position, pervents scratching of the bolt, and ensures a smooth sliding action.\r\n",
